# Code of Conduct

## Our Pledge
We pledge to make participation in our project a harassment-free experience for everyone.

## Our Standards
Examples of behavior that contributes to a positive environment include:
- Being respectful
- Accepting constructive criticism
- Showing empathy toward others

## Enforcement Responsibilities
Project maintainers are responsible for clarifying standards.

## Scope
This Code of Conduct applies within project spaces and public spaces.

## Enforcement
Instances of abusive behavior may be reported to project maintainers.

## Enforcement Guidelines
Warnings may be issued for unacceptable behavior.

## Attribution
Adapted from the Contributor Covenant.
## Enforcement Responsibilities

Project maintainers are responsible for clarifying and enforcing our standards of acceptable behavior and will take appropriate and fair corrective action in response to any behavior deemed inappropriate.
